    {
      "name": "⑤ 硬验收「submit 幂等」",
      "description": "★ `course_schedule` 的验收项之一。\n\n**幂等的定义是「效果与执行一次完全一致」**——所以重点不是「两次都 201」，而是**库里只多了一段正文**。\n\n幂等靠一次**抢占式 INSERT**：直接写台账，撞 `uk_idempotency` 就说明「有人先来了」。\n\n> ★ 这里靠唯一键判定是**正解**，而 claim lease 靠唯一键兜底是**反模式**。判据同一条：\n> **那个唯一键守的不变量，是不是就是你此刻要判定的那件事，且覆盖全部失败情形？**",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0. 准备：再排一棒（用于幂等验证）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"L16 幂等验收\",\n  \"channelId\": {{channelId}}\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/collaboration-sessions"
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('ticketCode', pm.response.json().contributionTicket.ticketCode);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('idemKey', 'l16-idem-' + Date.now());"
          ]}}],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "1. 领租约",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}/leases"
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('leaseToken', pm.response.json().leaseToken);"
          ]}}],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. submit（带固定 Idempotency-Key）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}" },
              { "key": "X-Turn-Lease-Token", "value": "{{leaseToken}}" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{idemKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"这段话只该出现一次。\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}/contributions"
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('draftUrl', pm.response.json().draftUrl);",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('firstBody', pm.response.text());"
          ]}}],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. ★ 重放：同 key + 同 body → 返回同一个响应，业务一行都不执行",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}" },
              { "key": "X-Turn-Lease-Token", "value": "{{leaseToken}}" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{idemKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"这段话只该出现一次。\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}/contributions"
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('201（而不是 409 —— 因为是同一笔，直接还给你上次的结果）', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "pm.test('★ 响应与首次【字节级一致】', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('firstBody')));",
            "pm.test('★ 注意：租约早已消费，若业务真的又执行一次，这里必然是 409 —— 201 本身就证明了业务没跑',",
            "  () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().ticketStatus).to.eql('DONE'));",
            "console.log('👉 打开草稿确认只有【一段】正文：' + pm.collectionVariables.get('draftUrl'));"
          ]}}],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. ★ 同 key + 不同 body → 409 KEY_REUSED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}" },
              { "key": "X-Turn-Lease-Token", "value": "{{leaseToken}}" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{idemKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"换了内容，但用了同一个幂等键。\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}/contributions"
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test('409', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
            "pm.test('IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED_WITH_DIFFERENT_BODY —— 一个 key 只能对应一件事',",
            "  () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED_WITH_DIFFERENT_BODY'));",
            "pm.test('先比 hash、后看状态：不管上一笔完成没完成，都不该把 A 的响应还给 B',",
            "  () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.not.eql('IDEMPOTENCY_REQUEST_IN_PROGRESS'));"
          ]}}],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "⑥ 安全边界（每条都必须失败）",
      "description": "泄漏边界按**租户**划，不按**机娘**划：\n\n- 跨主人 → **404**（403 等于承认「它存在、只是不给你」，会泄漏资源存在性）\n- 同主人名下的另一只机娘 → **403 ACPP_WRONG_AGENT**（本就彼此可见，藏起来没有安全收益，反而让机娘拿不到「该换回原机娘」这条自愈信息）",
      "item": [
        {
