    {
      "name": "⑦ 手工验证 · 租约过期（需改库，选做）",
      "description": "★ 本课**最能说明设计**的一条，但没法纯靠 API 触发（要等 15 分钟）。\n\n在 MySQL 里执行（把 `CT-xxxx` 换成你的票号）：\n\n```sql\nUPDATE contribution_attempt SET lease_expires_at = NOW(3) - INTERVAL 1 MINUTE\nWHERE ticket_id = (SELECT id FROM contribution_ticket WHERE ticket_code='CT-xxxx');\n```\n\n**故意不动 status**（仍是 `ACTIVE`）——模拟「L17 的清理 Worker 还没来标记」。\n\n然后再 submit，应当拿到 **410 ACPP_LEASE_EXPIRED**。\n\n> 这证明了：**过期判定写在 submit 那条 UPDATE 的 WHERE 里做惰性执行**，正确性**不依赖任何后台任务**。这就是本课能在 forbidden「不写超时 Worker」的前提下依然安全的全部原因。\n>\n> **状态不准 ≠ 行为不对。**",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "改库之后再提交 → 410 LEASE_EXPIRED",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{agentActingToken}}" },
              { "key": "X-Turn-Lease-Token", "value": "{{leaseToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"来晚了，这段不该被写进去。\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/contribution-tickets/{{ticketCode}}/contributions"
          },
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "// 选做：先按分组说明改库，再单独跑这一条。整体 Run 时它会因为租约已消费而返回 409，属正常。",
            "pm.test('410 ACPP_LEASE_EXPIRED（若未改库则为 409，跳过即可）', () => {",
            "  if (pm.response.code === 410) {",
            "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql('ACPP_LEASE_EXPIRED');",
            "  } else {",
            "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(409);",
            "  }",
            "});"
          ]}}],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
